{"title":"OpalRed","slug":"OpalRed","hero":{"file":"RawReOpal.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":2286,"revid":14164,"timestamp":"2024-07-26T16:16:07Z","lastEditor":"Fjsh","categories":["Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Ore","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$46/Stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$86/Stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.51.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"03/01/2024"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>OpalRed</b> can be found underwater in the tunnel river inside of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Red_Clay/\">Red Clay</a>.\n</p><p>After being refined, the name changes to Magma Opal. Raw Ore is worth $5/Stud.\n</p><p>It is one of three Opal ores, the others being <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalBlue/\">OpalBlue</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalBrown/\">OpalBrown</a>\n</p>"}
